    // 全部可用命令（命令面板 MarkdownPreviewEnhanced: 前缀下可见）：
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_toggle             Toggle Preview
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_close              Close Preview
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_refresh            Refresh Preview
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_presentation       Presentation Mode
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_insert_pagebreak   Insert Page Break
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_insert_notes       Insert Speaker Notes
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_copy_rich_text     Copy as Rich Text
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_paste_as_markdown  Paste as Markdown
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_export_html        Export HTML…
    //   markdown_preview_enhanced_export_pdf         Export PDF…
    // =====================================================================

